# Secure Boot facts of the built images, KEY=VALUE (docs/signing-keys.md says where each comes from). Optional pins, parsed by the workflows:
# NVIDIA_MODULE_SIGNER: the `modinfo -F signer` string of the NVIDIA kernel modules. EMPTY: the smoke test then compares the module key with the
# certificate /etc/pki/akmods/certs/akmods-ublue.der of the image only (read the signer name from the DIAG line of the first weekly NVIDIA build to pin it).
NVIDIA_MODULE_SIGNER=
